udowanych – rezystancja toru","otherTitles":[],"abstracts":[],"affiliations":[{"id":"5e70918b878c28a04737ded5","uid":"b1XGvJiw-TsKhXZq-S51_4g","uuid":"10104d5b-8342-476d-a50f-e84ec4c04676","name":"Sieć Badawcza Łukasiewicz - Instytut Elektrotechniki","affiliatedPersonIDs":["5e70943c878c28a0473b88d8"],"parentId":"5e70918b878c28a04737ded5","parentUuid":"10104d5b-8342-476d-a50f-e84ec4c04676","rootId":"5e70918b878c28a04737ded5","rootUuid":"10104d5b-8342-476d-a50f-e84ec4c04676","type":"AUTHOR"}],"mainLanguage":"pol","mainLanguageName":"polski","issue":"2","pagesFromTo":"32-34","articleEvaluation":{"indexedJournal":false,"isReview":true,"wosConference":false},"contributionOrder":{"AUTHOR":["5e70943c878c28a0473b88d8"]},"journal":{"objectId":"5e710ea346e0fb0001bb7c7c","title":"INŻYNIER BUDOWNICTWA","issn":"1732-3428","documentHash":"e7f4aace-0377-4f85-945a-fe3503700593"},"_version":4,"journalIssue":{"objectId":"64a3fd7540970738ce79e0e9","year":"2023","number":"2","documentHash":"ad770e8e-4a56-416e-9a63-acca3078412c"},"translation":false,"editors":[],"translators":[],"institutionProfile":true,"translationEditors":[],"keywords":[{"languageCode":"pol","keywords":["torowisko","budownictwo kolejowe"]}],"lastRefresh":"1761904478761"},{"authors":[{"objectId":"673b143efdbe8313779fb2e0","name":"Konrad","lastName":"DĄBAŁA","documentHash":"b359b615-044f-4ebd-89e5-b4eca5ab233a"},{"objectId":"5e70943b878c28a0473b88b1","name":"Maciej","lastName":"Bogumił","uuid":"E8B202ACFEDDE9EB9B8A69F5B9E817C44F3ADF047D769464AF574A982BF3C0A1CB8596D3B0D2E1AE66FB4784FE4C25FC50C171EAA02F29B979496235801FB73A","documentHash":"428ee489-af4f-4b0e-b878-61789c6bbf09"}],"openAccess":{"textVersion":"ORIGINAL_AUTHOR","license":"CC_BY_NC_ND","releaseDateMode":"AT_PUBLICATION","mode":"OPEN_JOURNAL","releaseDateMonth":"APRIL","releaseDateYear":2024},"objectId":"673b143efdbe8313779fb2de","doi":"10.15199/48.2024.04.01","publicUri":"https://sigma-not.pl/publikacja-148101-2024-4.html","type":"ARTICLE","typeName":"Artykuł","year":2024,"title":"Increasing the Efficiency of a High-efficiency Squirrel-cage  Induction Motor with Semi-closed Slots by Casting the Slots  with Ferro-resin Instead of Using Permanent Magnetic Wedges","otherTitles":[{"languageCode":"pol","title":"Zwiększanie wydajności wysokowydajnego silnika indukcyjnego klatkowego z półzamkniętymi szczelinami poprzez odlewanie szczelin za pomocą żelazożywicy zamiast stosowania stałych klinów magnetycznych"}],"abstracts":[{"languageCode":"pol","content":"W artykule przedstawiono nowy sposób na zwiększenie sprawności silników z półzamkniętymi żłobkami poprzez zalewanie żłobków ferro-żywicą zamiast stosowania trwałych klinów magnetycznych. Ten sposób zwiększania sprawności jest szczególnie ważny w przypadku silników o dużej sprawności. Wykonano obliczenia polowe (MES) oraz badania laboratoryjne silnika przed i po zalaniu żłobków ferro-żywicą. Przeprowadzono obliczenia optymalizacyjne w celu oszacowania redukcji zużycia materiałów aktywnych w silniku z zalanymi ferro-żywicą żłobkami. Na podstawie wyników badań laboratoryjnych i obliczeń przedstawiono wady i zalety zastosowania nowej metody."},{"languageCode":"eng","content":"This paper presents a new way to increase efficiency in motors with semi-closed slots by casting the slots with ferro-resin instead of using permanent magnetic wedges. This way of increasing efficiency is particularly important for high-efficiency motors. Field calculations (FEM) and laboratory tests of the motor before and after casting the slots with ferro-resin were performed. Optimization calculations were carried out to estimate the reduction in the use of active materials in a motor with ferro-resin casted slots. Based on the results of laboratory tests and calculations, the advantages and disadvantages of using the new method are presented."}],"affiliations":[{"id":"5e70918b878c28a04737ded5","uid":"b1XGvJiw-TsKhXZq-S51_4g","uuid":"10104d5b-8342-476d-a50f-e84ec4c04676","name":"Sieć Badawcza Łukasiewicz - Instytut Elektrotechniki","affiliatedPersonIDs":["5e70943b878c28a0473b88b1"],"parentId":"5e70918b878c28a04737ded5","parentUuid":"10104d5b-8342-476d-a50f-e84ec4c04676","rootId":"5e70918b878c28a04737ded5","rootUuid":"10104d5b-8342-476d-a50f-e84ec4c04676","type":"AUTHOR"}],"mainLanguage":"eng","mainLanguageName":"angielski","volume":"1","issue":"4","pagesFromTo":"3-7","articleEvaluation":{"indexedJournal":false,"isReview":true,"wosConference":false},"contributionOrder":{"AUTHOR":["673b143efdbe8313779fb2e0","5e70943b878c28a0473b88b1"]},"journal":{"objectId":"5e6f7d52878c28514547a366","mniswId":"16681","title":"Przegląd Elektrotechniczny","issn":"0033-2097","eissn":"0033-2097","documentHash":"c7332b39-1aae-4062-a4ea-233eca367e61"},"_version":4,"journalIssue":{"objectId":"673b143efdbe8313779fb2df","year":"2024","volume":"1","number":"4","documentHash":"b2df8232-e268-4039-9528-0570b7acaff6"},"translation":false,"editors":[],"translators":[],"institutionProfile":true,"translationEditors":[],"keywords":[],"lastRefresh":"1761905007869"},{"authors":[{"objectId":"5e709499878c28a0473c0286","name":"Renata","lastName":"Kłoś","uuid":"BF191531F15242E071287F8887788AB2742154AE7D96920D5BD2387062BCEB00CA24ECE82971EB31D449284FE6993D3B75EBA45638F844577E8B37D90058A885","documentHash":"38b0e9cb-73b4-4301-80ef-bf923a2680ef"},{"objectId":"5e70943c878c28a0473b894b","name":"Krzysztof","lastName":"Kogut","uuid":"190A7A2FE875E809E2C4F730D493E8193BCCBCD69DF844343C393234404A547D67EF113481DED6777A512E3FCB16259678DD3364BD1A25080DB43F103E87F276","orcidId":"0000-0002-9985-6815","documentHash":"54fffc3d-28a8-4fc5-bd4d-6333d3a957ad"},{"objectId":"5e70943c878c28a0473b8944","name":"Krzysztof","lastName":"Kasprzyk","uuid":"185E87258230BC8CD6EA4D7F5A7A64705D332B50C9F5330F71C94F5A1757CC46E755E595DB6AC217102DAEA6A6A75224673F8879AC6F7D345913A7C0FA0A6C63","orcidId":"0000-0001-8365-6838","documentHash":"388b1051-d304-41f1-9c37-30dc2479eb28"},{"objectId":"5e709381878c28a0473ab7a4","name":"Henryk","lastName":"Brzeziński","uuid":"BC9CEB7E480A3163F1DCB929A5E3BBBAFB88BE52812D2C11F2B81BBA7A1F1D41CE7762E0BBCA95774C35BB02AD0A331367ACF4CE567211598AAB01FDA7342DEB","documentHash":"96e78ead-5cec-4b9d-be30-e8d87a091081"}],"objectId":"6788ecfffdbe837345628d31","doi":"10.15199/48.2024.12.36","publicUri":"https://sigma-not.pl/publikacja-151790-2024-12.html","type":"ARTICLE","typeName":"Artykuł","year":2024,"title":"Alternative for SF6 – review and Łukasiewicz – Institute of Electrical Engineering (Ł - IEL) approach to the subject","otherTitles":[{"languageCode":"pol","title":"Alternatywy dla SF6 – przegląd oraz podejście Łukasiewicz – Instytutu Elektrotechniki (Ł – IEL)"}],"abstracts":[{"languageCode":"pol","content":"W Ł - IEL dokonano przeglądu literatury dotyczącej alternatyw dla SF6. Zbadano gazy izolacyjne przy napięciu przemiennym (50 Hz) i udarowym. Wyniki pokazują, że odpowiednio dobrane mieszaniny gazów mogą zwiększyć wytrzymałość elektryczną o kilkanaście procent w stosunku do powietrza, pozwalając na zmniejszenie odległości między elektrodami i gabarytów urządzeń. Mieszanina gazów (B) wykazuje wyższą wytrzymałość od powietrza przy napięciu udarowym przy ciśnieniach do 1 bara. Badania wspierają poszukiwanie ekologicznych alternatyw dla SF 6"},{"languageCode":"eng","content":"The literature about the alternatives to SF6 was reviewed. The mix of the insulating gases at the AC voltage (50 Hz) and lightning impulse voltage (LI) were tested. The results show that appropriately selected gas mixtures can increase the electrical strength by several percent compared to air. As a consequence, the distance between electrodes and the dimensions of the devices could be reduced. The gas mixture (B) has a higher strength than air under LI voltage at pressures up to 1 bar. The tests support the research for ecological alternatives to SF 6."}],"affiliations":[{"id":"5e70918b878c28a04737ded5","uid":"b1XGvJiw-TsKhXZq-S51_4g","uuid":"10104d5b-8342-476d-a50f-e84ec4c04676","name":"Sieć Badawcza Łukasiewicz - Instytut Elektrotechniki","affiliatedPersonIDs":["5e709499878c28a0473c0286","5e709381878c28a0473ab7a4","5e70943c878c28a0473b8944","5e70943c878c28a0473b894b"],"parentId":"5e70918b878c28a04737ded5","parentUuid":"10104d5b-8342-476d-a50f-e84ec4c04676","rootId":"5e70918b878c28a04737ded5","rootUuid":"10104d5b-8342-476d-a50f-e84ec4c04676","type":"AUTHOR"}],"mainLanguage":"eng","mainLanguageName":"angielski","volume":"1","issue":"12","pagesFromTo":"159-162","articleEvaluation":{"indexedJournal":false,"isReview":true,"wosConference":false},"contributionOrder":{"AUTHOR":["5e70943c878c28a0473b8944","5e70943c878c28a0473b894b","5e709381878c28a0473ab7a4","5e709499878c28a0473c0286"]},"journal":{"objectId":"5e6f7d52878c28514547a366","mniswId":"16681","title":"Przegląd Elektrotechniczny","issn":"0033-2097","eissn":"0033-2097","documentHash":"c7332b39-1aae-4062-a4ea-233eca367e61"},"_version":4,"journalIssue":{"objectId":"6757e4a7fdbe835dc1619471","year":"2024","volume":"1","number":"12","documentHash":"06010fd2-11dc-4f1c-9e2c-01d041909f51"},"translation":false,"editors":[],"translators":[],"institutionProfile":true,"translationEditors":[],"keywords":[{"languageCode":"pol","keywords":["SF6","izolacja gazowa","Potencjał Tworzenia Efektu Cieplarnianego","inżynieria wysokich napięć"]},{"languageCode":"eng","keywords":["SF6","gas insulation","Global Warming Potentia","high voltage engineering"]}],"lastRefresh":"1761905129612"},{"authors":[{"objectId":"6788fa05fdbe837345636623","name":"U.","lastName":"Świtała","documentHash":"ba0c305b-b9fd-4166-a39c-0eb4ef5596c7"},{"objectId":"67736539ece3981a38de0071","name":"Marcin","lastName":"Dudziak","uuid":"53B3B62FC9E3F280EE6B443F5AA0EA801E46911FED6EB5111E06DB8A9B90B453AF8DADC45DC29E9FC3CD04D5A78BF8126E6DC1162E6C458FCE91612DFBE91E1E","documentHash":"33430157-758f-495b-a092-91de3a65317b"},{"objectId":"673ffab8ece3984d1d4698ed","name":"Alicja","lastName":"Matusiak","uuid":"4F8CD805BBB5F02EBCD2120ADABE8C52682EB6285C9FF2525D950FE595FC0530B4245E8FCBD75E11FD211C3723C684994204A2E9D870171D4A9708DEEF75F6F9","documentHash":"3ba35790-2b42-4054-8a3a-483b9657033d"},{"objectId":"63d88b397523403f15be516b","name":"Wojciech","lastName":"Frydlewicz","uuid":"B845396254A1FFDE9270615779A9E1E2BF92A5A31A9CC4D77F88837CA31CF1C352DD7CA13E8BD65818835D76F039A8335CFFBA7DDDD3D0226A45C0C4B7D2EEA7","documentHash":"4e62a39e-586b-416a-acb1-c56e23ac2622"},{"objectId":"5ebed6f3752340254fc40914","name":"Patrycja","lastName":"Żurek-Siworska","uuid":"A50D3D99F314B8AFA3735C9352EC83D59CC1CDACDF7475779DF95D7A3D33ED1BC5A29DFB0CEAEE31782AD73A21C3CF48C1A68E713F53AD308BB3A18C8E296D0D","orcidId":"0000-0001-9157-1471","documentHash":"cef15f9e-a6e9-4e6a-8c97-d2b9361388de"},{"objectId":"5e709499878c28a0473c0284","name":"Grzegorz","lastName":"Górnicki","uuid":"536FE69660098F5353B1C5023EDD65F4F6950FD66CFB117F66593CB2A7247C32A430F71A80D6A9272CD24C4AD922D19B52CC30BF1DA59D5AA885B7DD7F9E5628","documentHash":"2c634925-f9eb-440c-acf8-f43cb1de49bf"},{"objectId":"5e70943c878c28a0473b895c","name":"Ewa","lastName":"Zawadzka","uuid":"2C53B0E9E35DBF50E8E33F798595A3D36DE48940D139A9626811C2BCFBB09E99AB2C9C3A350AD0B1F6FBAC88157D09F7B2E10D3E69FFBB494D48103E69BA341B","documentHash":"905dff02-3cb7-4692-89cb-ae02f9c7ff74"},{"objectId":"5e709381878c28a0473ab7a4","name":"Henryk","lastName":"Brzeziński","uuid":"BC9CEB7E480A3163F1DCB929A5E3BBBAFB88BE52812D2C11F2B81BBA7A1F1D41CE7762E0BBCA95774C35BB02AD0A331367ACF4CE567211598AAB01FDA7342DEB","documentHash":"96e78ead-5cec-4b9d-be30-e8d87a091081"}],"objectId":"6788fa05fdbe837345636621","doi":"10.1080/09276440.2024.2394728","publicUri":"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/pdf/10.1080/09276440.2024.2394728","type":"ARTICLE","typeName":"Artykuł","year":2024,"title":"Characterization of composite materials with recycled wind turbine blade additives using atomic force microscopy","otherTitles":[],"abstracts":[{"languageCode":"eng","content":"The European Union’s efforts to increase the share of renewable energy translate into a growing number of wind farms. Post-operation wind turbines become increasing waste. Recycling wind turbine blades is a challenge due to the materials used (composites) and high costs. The article examines the influence of recyclate from wind turbine blades (derived from mechanical recycling) on the image of topography and Lateral Force Microscopy (LFM) in atomic force microscopy (AFM). Upon adding the recycled material, an increase in surface roughness is observed despite its prior polishing. The Young’s modulus determined from force spectroscopy (AFM mode) indicated a small difference in values between the matrix and reinforcement areas. This proves the significant influence of the primary and secondary interphase on the properties of secondary composites, which is an area for further research."}],"affiliations":[{"id":"5e70918b878c28a04737ded5","uid":"b1XGvJiw-TsKhXZq-S51_4g","uuid":"10104d5b-8342-476d-a50f-e84ec4c04676","name":"Sieć Badawcza Łukasiewicz - Instytut Elektrotechniki","affiliatedPersonIDs":["63d88b397523403f15be516b","673ffab8ece3984d1d4698ed","5e709381878c28a0473ab7a4","5e709499878c28a0473c0284","5ebed6f3752340254fc40914","67736539ece3981a38de0071","5e70943c878c28a0473b895c"],"parentId":"5e70918b878c28a04737ded5","parentUuid":"10104d5b-8342-476d-a50f-e84ec4c04676","rootId":"5e70918b878c28a04737ded5","rootUuid":"10104d5b-8342-476d-a50f-e84ec4c04676","type":"AUTHOR"}],"mainLanguage":"eng","mainLanguageName":"angielski","pagesFromTo":"1-12","articleEvaluation":{"indexedJournal":false,"isReview":true,"wosConference":false},"contributionOrder":{"AUTHOR":["6788fa05fdbe837345636623","5e70943c878c28a0473b895c","5ebed6f3752340254fc40914","5e709381878c28a0473ab7a4","5e709499878c28a0473c0284","63d88b397523403f15be516b","673ffab8ece3984d1d4698ed","67736539ece3981a38de0071"]},"journal":{"objectId":"5e6f7d4b878c285145477768","mniswId":"4170","title":"COMPOSITE INTERFACES","issn":"0927-6440","eissn":"1568-5543","metadataSource":"WOS","documentHash":"81fb62ab-cb86-4f77-b2